<view class="screen">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="eyebrow">家庭记忆</view>
    <view class="title">{{activeFamily ? activeFamily.name : '家庭记忆'}}</view>
    <view class="subtitle">这里展示当前家庭最近的家庭记忆，也可以手动补记一条。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-text">{{error}}</view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="panel-title">新增一条家庭记忆</view>
    <textarea
      class="text-area"
      placeholder="比如：我们家每周日晚会一起复盘这周的开心事和难题"
      value="{{newContent}}"
      bindinput="handleInput"
    />
    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="handleCreateMemory">保存记忆</button>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="panel-title">最近保存</view>
    <view wx:if="{{memories.length === 0 && !loading}}" class="empty-state">
      还没有家庭记忆。可以从聊天回答里一键保存，或者直接在上面手动补记。
    </view>

    <view wx:for="{{memories}}" wx:key="id" class="panel">
      <view class="badge">{{item.type || 'FAMILY_STORY'}}</view>
      <view class="panel-copy">{{item.content}}</view>
      <view class="panel-copy muted">{{item.displayTime}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
